    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>gRPC support for Azure App Service is now available for Windows.&nbsp; Please see the <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/app-service-linux-docs/tree/master/HowTo/gRPC/Windows/.NET%208#how-to-deploy-a-net-8-application-using-grpc-on-windows-app-service-preview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">documentation</a> and <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7brvNO4NdvM&amp;t=22260s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">video</a> to learn more about enabling gRPC applications for Windows.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "gRPC support for Azure App Service is now available for Windows. Please see the documentation and video to learn more about enabling gRPC applications for Windows."
  },
